# Quantum Sovereign Enterprise Architecture

## Overview

The Quantum Sovereign Enterprise layer maximizes the synergy between the Edge Brain (Cloudflare Workers) and Sovereign Brain (VPS), completes the 24M-face ODPE topology, enables infinite memory architecture, and exposes a global enterprise API.

